&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Buyer Domain at Vinted is dedicated to creating a seamless and highly engaging experience for our members as they search, discover, and purchase items. Our challenge is unique: unlike standard e-commerce, our peer-to-peer catalogue consists of hundreds of millions of entirely unique, single-inventory listings, with millions of new items uploaded daily. Connecting the right buyer with the perfect item in real-time is at the very core of Vinted&#39;s success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The CVP team owns the core platform and services that govern how content is geofenced, balanced, and surfaced across Vinted&#39;s growing international network of markets. We build robust systems and tooling that manage cross-border visibility, enabling smooth and gradual market connections (e.g., FR-DE, BE-FR-ES) while optimising key liquidity metrics like Sell-Through Rate (STR%) and Gross Merchandise Value (GMV) by balancing the content in multiple channels.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team works closely with Content Visibility Management, Search, and Recommender relevance teams to accelerate product development. Currently, we are driving the automation of content visibility experimentation &amp;amp; analysis. Rather than having different content channels independently re-implement visibility controls, we are building a unified platform to provide autonomy to Decision Scientists. In addition, we are highly contributing in growing new large markets such as the USA and Australia.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Drive technical execution:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, implement, and maintain highly scalable, reliable, and secure backend systems to ensure efficient content visibility and search mechanisms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Guide technical decisions:&lt;/strong&gt; Contribute to and challenge the technical direction of our backend services, leading system design reviews and ensuring high-quality, maintainable code.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale features globally:&lt;/strong&gt; Implement and shape A/B tested features that positively impact our 80+ million users. Code changes are rolled out instantly to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own your services:&lt;/strong&gt; Monitor and improve backend service performance and stability. The team owns and monitors service-layer measurements (SLIs, SLOs, etc.) and has an on-call rotation which you will participate in.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lead team-level initiatives:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead and drive technical initiatives within the team, while collaborating on domain-wide integrations with other engineering teams (such as Search and Recommender relevance teams).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborate cross-functionally:&lt;/strong&gt; Work closely with engineering and product managers, analysts, and other stakeholders, facilitating clear communication within the team and across domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Contribute to product direction:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide technical feasibility assessments, identify technical risks, and provide effort estimations to help shape our team&#39;s product roadmap.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Foster engineering excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Mentor, guide, and share knowledge with other engineers in the team to support their technical growth and promote collaborative best practices&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive experience in backend software engineering, with a proven track record of designing and building scalable, distributed, and highly available systems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are highly proficient in backend development. We primarily use Go, Kotlin, Ruby, Python — while prior experience in these specific languages is beneficial, a strong foundation in modern backend engineering and a willingness to learn is what matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with event streaming platforms like Kafka, Apache Flink, or others for real-time data processing and message queueing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A track record working with search engines, information retrieval and ranking optimisations technologies (e.g., Vespa, Elasticsearch, OpenSearch) is a high advantage. If not, we expect you to have a strong willingness and motivation to learn.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are enthusiastic about AI technologies, use AI tools daily in your work, and proactively learn and experiment with how to adopt AI to boost engineering outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of continuous integration and deployment pipelines, with experience in tools like Jenkins for automating builds and deployments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with observability and monitoring tools (we use Grafana, Kibana, and others) to keep services healthy and define SLIs/SLOs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with relational and in-memory databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong collaboration and communication skills, with experience working with cross-functional peers (Product, Analytics, SRE).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in mentoring other engineers, providing constructive feedback, and promoting engineering best practices within your team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and spoken English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A daily lunch allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An NS mobility card&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionTitle__ZlnGI&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;JobsDescription_sectionContent__jYQtX&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€76.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€104.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Hunter Douglas is wereldwijd marktleider in raamdecoratie en een toonaangevende producent van architecturale producten. Wij zijn een merk dat u kent en vertrouwt. Met meer dan 100 jaar ervaring in innovatie hebben wij onze industrie mede vormgegeven met unieke producten die baanbrekend design en functionaliteit combineren. Onze producten zijn wereldwijd te vinden in miljoenen woningen en commerciële gebouwen. Wij zijn op zoek naar gedreven, intelligente, creatieve en ondernemende mensen. Door uitdagende functies en versnelde groeimogelijkheden te bieden, gedreven door een gezamenlijke ambitie om succesvol te zijn, creëren wij een omgeving waarin uw carrière zich verder kan ontwikkelen.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In ruil voor uw expertise bieden wij een competitief en uitgebreid arbeidsvoorwaardenpakket, zodat u zich gewaardeerd voelt voor de bijdrage die u levert.&amp;nbsp;Onze ambitie is om het snelst groeiende en meest geliefde raamdecoratiebedrijf ter wereld te worden. &lt;em&gt;Wat is uw ambitie?&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Product Manager Soft Fabrics&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wil jij bijdragen aan de ontwikkeling van hoogwaardige stoffen die hun weg vinden naar klanten door heel Europa? Krijg je energie van de combinatie van productontwikkeling, commercie en projectmanagement? Dan is dit een mooie kans om als Product Manager Soft Fabrics onderdeel te worden van ons Product Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Jouw rol&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Product Manager Soft Fabrics ben je verantwoordelijk voor het product en het commerciële succes van onze collecties voor gordijn- en meubelstoffen. Design is verantwoordelijk voor de creatieve ontwikkeling van de stoffen. Vanuit Product Management vertegenwoordig jij de markt-, klant- en businessbehoefte. Je brengt markt- en klantinzichten in en vertaalt deze naar duidelijke productbriefings en commerciële uitgangspunten. Vervolgens bewaak je samen met Design het ontwikkelproces en stuur je op een succesvolle productintroductie en optimale productlevenscyclus. Daarbij werk je nauw samen met collega&#39;s van Sales, Marketing, Procurement, Supply Chain en het Design Team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je combineert projectmanagement met commercieel inzicht, data-analyse en een passie voor textiel. Een veelzijdige rol waarin je veel verschillende mensen en disciplines bij elkaar brengt.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wat ga je doen?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je beheert het fabrics-portfolio gedurende de volledige productlevenscyclus, van concept tot uitfasering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Samen met Design vertaal je marktinzichten naar productbriefings en commerciële uitgangspunten voor nieuwe stoffen en collecties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je coördineert productontwikkelingsprojecten van conceptfase tot marktintroductie, waarbij je samenwerkt met Design voor de ontwikkeling van nieuwe stoffen en collecties.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bewaakt planning, voortgang, risico&#39;s, budget en afstemming tussen de verschillende betrokken teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je bent gedurende het ontwikkelproces een commerciële en strategische sparringpartner voor Design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je analyseert markt-, klant- en verkoopdata en vertaalt inzichten naar kansen voor het portfolio.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je ondersteunt bij prijsstelling, productpositionering en businesscases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je werkt samen met Sales en Marketing aan productintroducties, trainingen en commerciële tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Je zorgt voor goede productinformatie en bent een belangrijk aanspreekpunt voor interne en externe stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Dit breng jij mee&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent een junior/medior professional die graag verantwoordelijkheid neemt en energie krijgt van het verbinden van mensen, ideeën en projecten. Je hebt minimaal 2 jaar relevante ervaring in bijvoorbeeld productmanagement, projectmanagement, category management of een vergelijkbare functie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Daarnaast heb je:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een hbo diploma in bijvoorbeeld Bedrijfskunde, Marketing, Textieltechnologie of een vergelijkbare richting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sterke projectmanagement- en stakeholdermanagementvaardigheden.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commercieel inzicht en een klantgerichte instelling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Een analytische, data-gedreven manier van werken.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring met het managen van meerdere projecten en stakeholders tegelijk.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Goede beheersing van het Nederlands en Engels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interesse in AI en de mogelijkheden om hiermee productiviteit, inzichten en bedrijfsprocessen te verbeteren.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ervaring binnen een productieomgeving, textiel, interieurproducten of een industriële omgeving is een pré.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je bent georganiseerd, proactief en hands-on. Je houdt gemakkelijk overzicht, ook wanneer er verschillende belangen en deadlines spelen. Tegelijkertijd werk je graag samen en weet je anderen mee te krijgen in jouw aanpak.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Waarom deze rol?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Je komt terecht bij Artex in Aarle-Rixtel, maar bent deel van het Product Team van Hunter Douglas met hoofdkantoor in Rotterdam. Hunter Douglas is een wereldwijd toonaangevende speler in raamdecoratie en architecturale producten, met meer dan 100 jaar ervaring in innovatie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Als Product Manager Soft Fabrics krijg je de ruimte om eigenaarschap te nemen, ideeën in te brengen en zichtbaar bij te dragen aan de toekomst van ons stoffenportfolio. Je werkt samen met collega&#39;s uit verschillende disciplines en landen en hebt een belangrijke rol in het verbinden van design, commercie en productontwikkeling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wil jij jouw ervaring inzetten in een rol waarin product, commercie en design samenkomen? Dan maken we graag kennis met je.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 8pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Door hieronder je sollicitatie in te dienen, geef je vooraf toestemming om sms-berichten te ontvangen om je op de hoogte te stellen van updates over de status van je sollicitatie en om gedurende je sollicitatieproces met je in gesprek te gaan. Je kunt de sms-service op elk moment annuleren. Stuur gewoon “STOP” als antwoord op een van onze sms-berichten om je af te melden. Er kunnen kosten voor berichten en data van toepassing zijn. De frequentie van berichten kan variëren. Als je vragen hebt over privacy, lees dan ons privacybeleid, &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link fai-bebop ___1myvvpj f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1bwia3u f1eh06m1 f1xeumsx fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f132whgj f1v74mp6 f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm&quot; href=&quot;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-tabster=&quot;{&amp;quot;restorer&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:1}}&quot;&gt;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt; of onze gebruiksvoorwaarden &lt;a class=&quot;fui-Link fai-bebop ___1myvvpj f2hkw1w f3rmtva f1ewtqcl f16muhyy f1k6fduh f1w7gpdv f1mo0ibp fjoy568 ff5ikls f1s184ao f1mk8lai fnbmjn9 f1o700av f13mvf36 f33ey8m f9n3di6 f1ids18y f1tx3yz7 f1bwia3u f1eh06m1 f1xeumsx fhgqx19 f1olyrje f1p93eir f1nev41a f132whgj f1v74mp6 f1tsf1ni fnq52rx f16zlvvm&quot; href=&quot;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/terms-of-use&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; data-tabster=&quot;{&amp;quot;restorer&amp;quot;:{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:1}}&quot;&gt;https://www.hunterdouglas.com/terms-of-use&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Who &lt;strong&gt;We Are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lightning AI is the company behind PyTorch Lightning. Founded in 2019, we build an end-to-end platform for developing, training, and deploying AI systems—designed to take ideas from research to production with less friction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Through our merger with Voltage Park, a neocloud and AI Factory, Lightning AI combines developer-first software with cost-efficient, large-scale compute. Teams get the tools they need for experimentation, training, and production inference, with security, observability, and control built in.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We serve solo researchers, startups, and large enterprises. Lightning AI operates globally with offices in New York City, San Francisco, Seattle, and London, and is backed by Coatue, Index Ventures, Bain Capital Ventures, and Firstminute.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 class=&quot;PDq2pG_selectionAnchorContainer&quot; data-section-id=&quot;o4nw1n&quot; data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;18&quot;&gt;The Way We Work&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;20&quot; data-end=&quot;222&quot;&gt;The people who thrive here are builders who move fast, communicate openly, take ownership, and continuously improve themselves, their teams, and our company. Here&#39;s what that looks like in practice:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vkpt18&quot; data-start=&quot;319&quot; data-end=&quot;461&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;321&quot; data-end=&quot;343&quot;&gt;Move with Urgency:&lt;/strong&gt; We move quickly, make thoughtful decisions, and keep momentum. We value action over perfection and learn by shipping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1c7e9p5&quot; data-start=&quot;462&quot; data-end=&quot;598&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;464&quot; data-end=&quot;483&quot;&gt;Take Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; We own outcomes, not just our individual work. We make decisions that move the company forward and follow through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1wm6yoj&quot; data-start=&quot;599&quot; data-end=&quot;751&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;601&quot; data-end=&quot;624&quot;&gt;Communicate Openly:&lt;/strong&gt; We communicate directly, seek to understand, and create clarity for others. Honest conversations help us move faster together.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1w7531e&quot; data-start=&quot;752&quot; data-end=&quot;874&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;754&quot; data-end=&quot;776&quot;&gt;Build Great Teams:&lt;/strong&gt; We lead by example, empower others, and create healthy teams where people can do their best work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;jb6f5l&quot; data-start=&quot;875&quot; data-end=&quot;1036&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;877&quot; data-end=&quot;895&quot;&gt;Raise the Bar:&lt;/strong&gt; We&#39;re always improving ourselves. We learn from feedback, consistently challenge ourselves to grow, and focus on the work that matters most.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;12lc0uc&quot; data-start=&quot;1037&quot; data-end=&quot;1184&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;1039&quot; data-end=&quot;1059&quot;&gt;Think Long-Term:&lt;/strong&gt; We design for what&#39;s next. We create scalable systems, simplify complexity, and use AI and automation to amplify our impact.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;c-message_actions__container c-message__actions&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What We&#39;re Looking For&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Fullstack Engineer to help develop and scale the Lightning AI platform across the frontend, CLI, APIs, and core backend systems. In this role, you’ll take ownership of key features and drive them end-to-end, working closely with engineering, product, and design to ship high-quality, iterative improvements.&amp;nbsp;This is an opportunity to build systems that support real-world machine learning workloads at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in one of our hubs (NYC, SF, Seattle, or London), with a minimum of 2 in-office days per week and occasional team and company offsites. We are not able to provide visa sponsorship for this position at this time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
